{"findings": [{"function_id": "django:db/migrations/autodetector.py:1006:create_renamed_fields", "category": "重复计算", "evidence_lines": [16, 21], "evidence": "            for rem_app_label, rem_model_name, rem_field_name in sorted(
                old_field_keys - self.new_field_keys
            ):
                if rem_app_label == app_label and rem_model_name == model_name:
                    old_field = old_model_state.get_field(rem_field_name)
                    old_field_dec = self.deep_deconstruct(old_field)", "impact": "外层循环每处理一个新的字段名，都会重新对 old_field_keys - self.new_field_keys 求差集并排序，且对每个候选旧字段重新 deep_deconstruct。当模型字段较多时，同一批候选旧字段会被反复计算，属于可避免的重复开销，也让内层循环的意图（只比较同一模型的旧字段）不够直观。", "suggestion": "在进入外层循环前先计算一次候选集合，例如 candidates = sorted(old_field_keys - self.new_field_keys)，并在内层循环中按 (app_label, model_name) 过滤；如需进一步优化，可预先按模型分组或缓存 deep_deconstruct 结果。", "needs_context": false}, {"function_id": "django:db/migrations/autodetector.py:1006:create_renamed_fields", "category": "多层控制流", "evidence_lines": [22, 38], "evidence": "                    if (
